// Ch4 C4-06 "The dock in the dark" (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch04.md; §0 reconciles it with B11,
// ch03_dock_at_night, which must not be repeated: no re-asking, no re-swearing).
// The village is dark: every lamp is at the wall behind them, small and far. The dock is lit only by
// the sea-glow from below, cyan on the underside of everything (beautiful and wrong). Rhen sits at the
// dock's end, legs over the water; Asha comes down the planks with two pieces of brown sugar cake on a
// leaf and sits down beside him (the Prologue's staging reversed). Toma stops at the shore end.
// Shots: H13 (35 mm, 0.4 m above the water, from the water side, looking up and back toward the dark
// village) -> H14 (85 mm, Asha single: the facial beat) -> H13. NEVER the ending_dock axis: no shot
// along the planks out to sea from behind her, and she never stands alone at the dock end.
// The beats: 1 his line first (voice guide); 2 the cake and a wait of at least 5 s, no music; 3 why
// nobody told him; 4 her tell, Oruvel (the choice: ch04_rhen_named_kell); 5 the smile goes while he
// isn't looking (@face asha neutral, held 0.8 s) and is back before he turns (@face asha soft_smile
// 0.3). Rhen never sees it. Shown, never said. No VO. 6 he's still coming; what she hears; 7 Toma on
// the shore-end post.
// Watches: no embrace, no kiss, no held hands; the cake is the only thing passed between them. Asha
// doesn't cry. No line links the lantern, the comb or the lantern-man to Rhen or to Dace (ADR 0022);
// her comb is in her hair and nobody mentions it.
// Music: hearer_hum (ambience only). The chapter flow sets ch04_dock_comforted after it.
title: ch04_dock_in_the_dark
location: ch04/haluna_wake
---
@fade in 1.5
@music hearer_hum fade=2.0
@camera H13
@anim rhen sit_dock_edge
@mark asha dock_end walk
@anim asha sit_beside rhen
@mark toma dock_shore walk
Rhen [angry]: Don't. Don't be kind about it. Just let me be angry for a minute. #line:ch04_dock_001
@anim asha hold_out_cake rhen
@wait 6.0
@anim rhen take_cake
Rhen [neutral]: Why did nobody tell me? #line:ch04_dock_002
Asha [neutral]: Everyone did. In pieces. And I let them. #line:ch04_dock_003
Asha [tender]: You looked at me on the beach like I was a person. I wanted two days of that. #line:ch04_dock_004
@wait 1.5
Asha [soft_smile]: Tell me about Oruvel. What did it sound like in the morning? #line:ch04_dock_005
-> Tell her about Oruvel. #line:ch04_dock_006
    <<set $ch04_rhen_named_kell = true>>
    Rhen [soft_smile]: Gulls. Rope on wood. Forty cookboats all burning breakfast at once. #line:ch04_dock_007
    Rhen [tender]: And Mother Kell, shouting at divers. She sold wicks. She sold everything. #line:ch04_dock_008
    <<if $ch01_kell_side_scene>>
    Rhen [soft_smile]: She said the sea owed her a favour. #line:ch04_dock_009
    <<endif>>
    <<if $ch02_rhen_stayed_with_dead>>
    Asha [tender]: Mother Kell. You said it on the beach. #line:ch04_dock_010
    <<endif>>
-> Not tonight. #line:ch04_dock_011
    Asha [soft_smile]: Then another night. I'll still want to know. #line:ch04_dock_012
@camera H14
@anim rhen look_out_to_sea
@face asha neutral 0.3
@wait 0.8
@anim rhen look_back asha
@face asha soft_smile 0.3
@camera H13
Rhen [determined]: I'm still coming. #line:ch04_dock_013
Asha [soft_smile]: I know. I said yes before Toma could stop me. #line:ch04_dock_014
@anim asha look_out_to_sea
Asha [neutral]: I can hear them. It's like someone humming in the next room. All the time. #line:ch04_dock_015
Rhen [worried]: Is Oruvel in there? #line:ch04_dock_016
// M4-A2P-1010: a long hold, Asha still looking out to sea: she chooses not to answer, to spare him
@wait 3.0
Asha [tender]: Eat your cake, Rhen. #line:ch04_dock_017
@anim toma sit_post
Asha [tender]: He'll sit there all night. He did it the night I was named. #line:ch04_dock_018
@wait 2.0
@camera release
===
